  {
   "text": "A government paid cash for dead cobras, and somehow ended up with more cobras.",
   "start": 0.06,
   "end": 4.899291666666667
  },
  {
   "text": "The story goes: colonial Delhi had a cobra problem.",
   "start": 5.039291666666666,
   "end": 8.434979166666666
  },
  {
   "text": "So the officials offered a reward for every dead cobra.",
   "start": 8.574979166666667,
   "end": 11.806354166666667
  },
  {
   "text": "At first, it worked.",
   "start": 11.946354166666667,
   "end": 13.1563125
  },
  {
   "text": "Dead snakes came in by the basket.",
   "start": 13.2963125,
   "end": 15.2974375
  },
  {
   "text": "Then somebody did the math.",
   "start": 15.4374375,
   "end": 16.959291666666665
  },
  {
   "text": "Why hunt cobras, when you can farm them?",
   "start": 17.099291666666666,
   "end": 19.4315625
  },
  {
   "text": "More snakes, more cash.",
   "start": 19.5715625,
   "end": 21.0093125
  },
  {
   "text": "Business was booming.",
   "start": 21.1493125,
   "end": 22.4185
  },
  {
   "text": "The officials noticed the numbers made no sense.",
   "start": 22.5585,
   "end": 25.188583333333334
  },
  {
   "text": "So they cancelled the reward.",
   "start": 25.328583333333334,
   "end": 26.848291666666668
  },
  {
   "text": "Now the breeders had crates of worthless snakes.",
   "start": 26.988291666666665,
   "end": 29.624833333333335
  },
  {
   "text": "So they let them go.",
   "start": 29.764833333333332,
   "end": 31.0213125
  },
  {
   "text": "The city ended up with more cobras than before.",
   "start": 31.1613125,
   "end": 33.85627083333333
  },
  {
   "text": "Economists still call it the Cobra Effect.",
   "start": 33.996270833333334,
   "end": 36.395625
  },
  {
   "text": "Pay people to solve a problem, and they'll make sure it never ends.",
   "start": 36.535625,
   "end": 40.24635416666667
  }
 ]
